{"term": {"label": "義", "variants": []}, "source": {"id": "5A", "url": "https://ctext.org/mengzi/wan-zhang-i", "title": "萬章上", "description": "萬章問曰：「舜往于田，號泣于旻天，何為其號泣也？」\n孟子曰：「怨慕也。」\n萬章曰：「父母愛之，喜而不忘；父母惡之，勞而不怨。然則舜怨乎？」\n曰：「長息問於公明高曰：『舜往于田，則吾既得聞命矣；號泣于旻天，于父母，則吾不知也。』公明高曰：『是非爾所知也。』夫公明高以孝子之心，為不若是恝，我竭力耕田，共為子職而已矣，父母之", "occurrences": 6, "data": null}, "network": {"directed": false, "multigraph": false, "graph": {}, "nodes": [{"form": "中", "id": "中"}, {"form": "仁", "id": "仁"}, {"form": "命", "id": "命"}, {"form": "喪", "id": "喪"}, {"form": "娶", "id": "娶"}, {"form": "年", "id": "年"}, {"form": "弟", "id": "弟"}, {"form": "樂", "id": "樂"}, {"form": "畎", "id": "畎"}, {"form": "畝", "id": "畝"}, {"form": "畢", "id": "畢"}, {"form": "義", "id": "義"}, {"form": "聞", "id": "聞"}, {"form": "處", "id": "處"}, {"form": "誅", "id": "誅"}, {"form": "道", "id": "道"}], "edges": [{"weight": 3.8110970868381857, "source": "畝", "target": "中"}, {"weight": 4.321922710604176, "source": "畝", "target": "畎"}, {"weight": 3.9164576024960116, "source": "畝", "target": "處"}, {"weight": 3.2233104219360666, "source": "畝", "target": "樂"}, {"weight": 2.3760125615488628, "source": "畝", "target": "道"}, {"weight": 3.4746248502169728, "source": "樂", "target": "道"}, {"weight": 2.7124847981700757, "source": "樂", "target": "中"}, {"weight": 3.2233104219360666, "source": "樂", "target": "畎"}, {"weight": 3.2233104219360666, "source": "樂", "target": "處"}, {"weight": 2.7124847981700757, "source": "處", "target": "仁"}, {"weight": 2.0193376176101303, "source": "處", "target": "年"}, {"weight": 3.628775530044231, "source": "處", "target": "義"}, {"weight": 3.405631978730021, "source": "處", "target": "中"}, {"weight": 3.9164576024960116, "source": "處", "target": "畎"}, {"weight": 2.3760125615488628, "source": "處", "target": "道"}, {"weight": 3.8110970868381857, "source": "中", "target": "畎"}, {"weight": 1.8651869377828723, "source": "中", "target": "道"}, {"weight": 3.1179499062782403, "source": "義", "target": "仁"}, {"weight": 2.424802725718295, "source": "義"